            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "The Office of Dr Mahamudu Bawumia has released a strong statement distancing the flagbearer of the New Patriotic Party from the recent arrest of a political opponent. Issued on Wednesday July 22 2026, the press release addresses a growing controversy surrounding a local political figure.\n​The issue centers on an organizer for the National Democratic Congress based in Agona West. The young man was recently arrested and brought before the court on charges of allegedly publishing false news and making offensive comments directed at Dr Bawumia."
