              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "The legal dispute over one of the most prominent luxury properties in the capital has reached a boiling point. The Accra High Court has officially authorized the police to step in and assist a designated Receiver in taking physical possession of the famous Number One Oxford Street Hotel."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
