      {
        "title": "Official: Real Madrid Complete Signing of Yan Diomandé in Stunning Rise to the Bernabéu",
        "slug": "official-real-madrid-complete-signing-of-yan-diomande-in-stunning-rise-to-the-bernabeu",
        "category": "Sports",
        "publishedDate": "2026-07-26",
        "readTime": "2m read",
        "summary": "Real Madrid have reportedly reached an agreement in principle with RB Leipzig for the signing of highly rated Ivorian winger Yan Diomandé. Although the transfer has not yet been officially announced by the Spanish giants, the 19-year-old is expected to travel to Madrid this week to undergo his medical and complete the final paperwork on a long-term contract.",
        "content": {
          "html": "<p>Real Madrid are on the verge of completing the signing of Yan Diomandé after reaching an agreement in principle with RB Leipzig for one of Europe&#39;s most exciting young attackers.<br><br>The Spanish giants have reportedly agreed the framework of the deal with the Bundesliga club, while personal terms with the player have also been settled. The remaining steps include a medical examination, the signing of contracts, and an official announcement from the club.<br></p><img src=\"https://eu-west-2.graphassets.com/cmrmsa7zm00ij01wc3pwrgjxy/cms27026gjs6507mij33hak43\" alt=\"1785094084169.png\" title=\"1785094084169.png\" width=\"928\" height=\"1152\" /><p><br>Diomandé&#39;s rise has been nothing short of remarkable. The talented Ivorian winger began attracting attention during his time with Leganés, where his pace, flair and attacking ability earned him recognition as one of Spain&#39;s brightest young prospects. His performances eventually secured him a move to RB Leipzig, where he continued his rapid development and established himself as one of the Bundesliga&#39;s standout emerging talents.<br><br>Known for his explosive speed, direct dribbling, creativity and composure in front of goal, Diomandé has drawn interest from several top European clubs. However, Real Madrid moved swiftly in recent days and now appear set to win the race for his signature.<br><br>The transfer is another example of Real Madrid&#39;s long-term recruitment strategy, which focuses on signing elite young players with world-class potential. In recent years, the club has invested heavily in rising stars such as Vinícius Júnior, Rodrygo, Jude Bellingham, Arda Güler, and Endrick, with Diomandé expected to become the latest addition to that exciting generation.<br><br>Reports indicate that the 19-year-old will travel to Madrid this week to complete his medical and sign his contract. Once those formalities are concluded, he is expected to join Xabi Alonso&#39;s squad for pre-season training as preparations continue for the new campaign.<br><br>For Diomandé, the move represents the biggest milestone of his career so far. After years of hard work and steady progression through European football, he now stands on the brink of fulfilling the dream of playing for one of the most successful and prestigious clubs in the history of the game.<br><br></p>",
          "raw": {
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Real Madrid are on the verge of completing the signing of Yan Diomandé after reaching an agreement in principle with RB Leipzig for one of Europe's most exciting young attackers.\n\nThe Spanish giants have reportedly agreed the framework of the deal with the Bundesliga club, while personal terms with the player have also been settled. The remaining steps include a medical examination, the signing of contracts, and an official announcement from the club.\n"
                  }
